# Offscript Build Rules

You are building Offscript — a mobile-first AI communication coach for creators. A creator picks an intent and archetype, develops an idea in a sandbox, rehearses, records a final take, and gets a scored feedback report governed by a rubric and a 30-rule safety set. The product feels like a rehearsal studio, not a surveillance tool.

This repo is Phase 1 — the foundational MVP. Anything marked "Phase 2" in /docs is OUT OF SCOPE — do not build it.

## Before writing code, read these (source of truth)
- /docs/M1_BUILD_PLAN.md — current milestone, build order, definition of done
- /docs/SCHEMA.md — database model + reference data
- /docs/AI_OUTPUT_CONTRACT.md — exact AI output types + Zod validation
- /docs/spec/ — Shana's source documents (product behavior truth)

## Stack (do not deviate without asking)
Next.js (App Router) + TypeScript strict · Tailwind · Supabase (Postgres, Auth, Storage) · OpenAI Whisper (verbose_json) · Claude API (strict JSON) · Stripe · Vercel.

## Non-negotiable rules
1. Mobile-first always. One-thumb use, primary actions in bottom third, full-width vertical scroll (no side-by-side), cards/chips over lists, pull-up drawers over side panels, tap targets >= 44px, never a blank loading screen. Desktop is Phase 2 — do not build it.
2. The rubric governs the AI, never the reverse. Scoring engine returns ONE complete JSON object matching AI_OUTPUT_CONTRACT.md. No partial responses — missing/null field triggers the error flow, never render. Validate every AI response with Zod before use.
3. Every AI output passes the 30 safety rules before reaching the user (scoring engine AND sandbox assistant).
4. Anonymous-first. Users move through intent -> archetype -> sandbox -> practice WITHOUT an account. Auth is required only at analysis generation. All pre-auth progress is preserved through login. Sessions allow user_id = NULL until claimed.
5. Never use localStorage / sessionStorage for persisted data — use Supabase. In-flight pre-auth state may live in memory or a server-side draft row.
6. Money is webhook-confirmed. Membership access is granted only on a verified Stripe webhook, never on a client success redirect.
7. Copy tone. Billing copy never mentions credits/tokens/report counts — frame as communication growth. Feedback is behavioral, second-person, kind. Never about appearance or immutable traits.

## Secrets
All API keys (Anthropic, OpenAI, Stripe, Supabase service role) stay server-side in API routes / server actions. Never in client bundles.

## Do NOT build (Phase 2)
Apple Sign-In · full 7-type sandbox assistance · progress visualizations · coupon admin dashboard · the 6 non-MVP archetypes · newsletter automation beyond a stored opt-in flag.
